---

Leylines is an Iron’s school. Install it next to [Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks) on NeoForge 1.21.1.

Craft the **Leyline Codex** and a **Ley Staff** when you want to lean into the school. The spells themselves are still Iron’s spells. They drop, craft, and sit on [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar) like anything else.

If the pack also has [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex), Leyline shows up as another tab. Discover, unlock, equip. You do not get a second HUD.

Without Codex, play it the old Iron’s way: find the scrolls, put them on the bar or in a book.

The world half of the mod happens at night. Pillars of light. Walk to them. That is the rift loop, and it is the part people miss if they only read the spell list.
